### Problem 5 — a runnable request collection (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
@host = http://localhost:3000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness (checks the database)
GET {{host}}/ready

### 1. Create a swap order
# @name create
POST {{api}}/swap-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromCurrency": "eth",
  "toCurrency": "usdc",
  "fromAmount": "1.5",
  "rate": "2500",
  "walletAddress": "0x71C7656EC7ab88b098defB751B7401B5f6d8976F",
  "note": "Created from requests.http"
}

@orderId = {{create.response.body.data.id}}

### 2. List with filters
GET {{api}}/swap-orders?status=PENDING&fromCurrency=ETH&minAmount=1&limit=5&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc

### 2b. Free-text search
GET {{api}}/swap-orders?q=requests.http

### 3. Get one
GET {{api}}/swap-orders/{{orderId}}

### 4. Partial update
PATCH {{api}}/swap-orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Updated", "fromAmount": "2" }

### 4b. Advance the status (PENDING -> CONFIRMED is legal)
PATCH {{api}}/swap-orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CONFIRMED" }

### 4c. Illegal transition — expect 409
PATCH {{api}}/swap-orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PENDING" }

### 5. Delete
DELETE {{api}}/swap-orders/{{orderId}}

### Validation failure — expect 422 with per-field details
POST {{api}}/swap-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromCurrency": "ETH", "toCurrency": "ETH", "fromAmount": "-1", "rate": "0" }
